# dependencies & build
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# env & secrets (never commit)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
security/
*.secret
*.secret.*

# generated tenant output & scratch
out/
tmp/
*.log

# scraper output (generated lead lists)
leads-*.json

# generator output (generated mock pages + previews)
mock-*.html
mock-preview*.png

# kb-shot verification artifacts (the committed captures live under kb/entries/)
kb-shot-*.png

# shot-*.mts guard artifacts. These guards are behavioural (they DRIVE the widget in
# a browser); the PNG is a by-product a human looks at when one goes red, never a
# committed asset. They were unignored while nothing ran them — wiring them into
# hooks/pre-commit on 2026-09-14 would have littered the repo root on every commit
# that touches the runtime.
shot-guest-booking-*.png
shot-review-form-*.png

# provisioned tenant sites (data plane — per-tenant snapshots, not source)
# Both spellings on purpose: in a worktree `sites` is a SYMLINK into the main tree,
# and a trailing-slash pattern never matches a symlink (git sees a file, not a dir).
# That exact gap once let a per-worktree symlink land and clobber a real directory.
sites
sites/

# local dev screenshot helper (hardcodes a local chromium path)
shot.mjs

# ontology distiller runtime artifacts (review docs are human-read then applied)
_planning/DOMAIN/_inbox/.work/
_planning/DOMAIN/_inbox/*.md
# The distiller's idempotency log is MACHINE STATE, not source. It was tracked, and
# the weekly cron writes it IN THE MAIN TREE — which made the tree permanently dirty,
# so citoviso-main-sync refused to update (correctly: ADR-0052 says the main tree is
# not a workspace). Measured 2026-09-08: 2921 of 2921 sync refusals came from this one
# file, and the :4600 test surface silently fell 19 commits behind for two days.
_planning/DOMAIN/_tools/.distill-manifest
# ⛔ UGYANAZ A KÁR, UGYANAZ A KÖNYVTÁR — csak ezt kihagytuk (mérve 2026-09-22). A
# `.distill-applied` az átvezető append-only AUDIT-naplója: gépi állapot, nem forrás. A
# `distill-apply.mts --go` MINDEN futáskor írja, és a cron a FŐ FÁRA mutat — vagyis a heti
# desztillálás minden alkalommal követetlen fájlt hagyott a fő fában, ami a fenti sor szerint
# már egyszer megállította a main-sync-et (2921/2921 visszautasítás, 19 commit lemaradás).
_planning/DOMAIN/_tools/.distill-applied

